I could be off here, as I'm a bit rusty, but geom_bar summarizes things. When you use geom_tile it shows very clearly that you have elements that switch from one level of "correlate" to another and sometimes back again, which geom_bar doesn't seem to be able to go back.

I'm not sure that it can, but could be wrong. I imagine that it forces things to be added up so it shows you proportion of time in a given state of "correlate".

