You get a similar effect using the legend.text.align theme element. Compare the following:

p<-ggplot(data=PlantGrowth, aes(x=group, y=weight, fill=group)) + geom_boxplot()

p + theme(legend.text.align = 0)
p + theme(legend.text.align = 1)
p + theme(legend.text.align = -10)

I would have expected each legend text item to be translated the same distance, so I would concur that something appears amiss.

Dennis

