A simple example works fine for me.

df <- data.frame(x=1:3, y=1:3)
p <- ggplot(df, aes(x, y)) + geom_path()
p2 <- ggplot(df, aes(x, y)) + geom_path(lty=2)

ggsave(("~/Desktop/hello.jpg"), p)
ggsave(("~/Desktop/hello2.jpg"), p2)
ggsave(("~/Desktop/hello.png"), p)
ggsave(("~/Desktop/hello2.png"), p2)

Perhaps there is a bug, in using polar coordinates or something like that, but without MWEs (see the instructions at the bottom of the email), it is hard to tell.

