Subject: Error when using fortify -- IllegalArgumentException
Message-ID: <149gF4vHEgs.wQegCXEFyXgJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/149gF4vHEgs/m/wQegCXEFyXgJ>
